    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Save the inhabitants of the Jagged Isles from the frenzy of the Steamboat fiend, Willie.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/a5a0daaa801c63998ef29cc240315e9a.avif?t=1751843625\" data-has-big width=800 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/c30f77263aa2fce7dd8ff81b28e891ca.poster.avif?t=1751843625\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/c30f77263aa2fce7dd8ff81b28e891ca.webm?t=1751843625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you travel the seas, Willie will be on the hunt for you, so prepare to fight for your life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/01e9bc9f7d6512197ed44c813f7e19f5.avif?t=1751843625\" data-has-big width=800 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/5dd7465536947d6e45f9e6d68723fb7b.poster.avif?t=1751843625\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/5dd7465536947d6e45f9e6d68723fb7b.webm?t=1751843625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate across the sea in a Steamboat of your own and explore the hidden secrets of the Jagged Isles.</strong><br><br>The ocean is unforgiving, so don't fall overboard as you will surely drown. Keep an ear out for Willie's whistling, or Willie might sneak up on you and drag you asunder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/d742368b94855fd27dfe5c68efa94ed4.avif?t=1751843625\" data-has-big width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/36c3daf40f518f0ad3b98bf37d8c3391.poster.avif?t=1751843625\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/36c3daf40f518f0ad3b98bf37d8c3391.webm?t=1751843625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish and collect scrap to help you and the other survivors going. Use scrap to upgrade your boat and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/d7e26bbbeee5dfaa06395d83033ee273.avif?t=1751843625\" data-has-big width=800 height=155 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/a45edb0a7e03e6bcd634855ec6e73e91.poster.avif?t=1751843625\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/a45edb0a7e03e6bcd634855ec6e73e91.webm?t=1751843625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep up with the other survivors on the island. Defeating Willie will require all the help you can get.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature list</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore open-world islands filled with hidden secrets and deadly threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself against Willie, the relentless steamboat spider stalking land and sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your steamboat with weapons and fishing gear to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage scarce resources - scavenge, fish, and upgrade to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate with survivors, forging vital bonds.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Save the inhabitants of the Jagged Isles from the frenzy of the Steamboat fiend, Willie.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/a5a0daaa801c63998ef29cc240315e9a.avif?t=1751843625\" data-has-big width=800 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/c30f77263aa2fce7dd8ff81b28e891ca.poster.avif?t=1751843625\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/c30f77263aa2fce7dd8ff81b28e891ca.webm?t=1751843625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you travel the seas, Willie will be on the hunt for you, so prepare to fight for your life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/01e9bc9f7d6512197ed44c813f7e19f5.avif?t=1751843625\" data-has-big width=800 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/5dd7465536947d6e45f9e6d68723fb7b.poster.avif?t=1751843625\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/5dd7465536947d6e45f9e6d68723fb7b.webm?t=1751843625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate across the sea in a Steamboat of your own and explore the hidden secrets of the Jagged Isles.</strong><br><br>The ocean is unforgiving, so don't fall overboard as you will surely drown. Keep an ear out for Willie's whistling, or Willie might sneak up on you and drag you asunder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/d742368b94855fd27dfe5c68efa94ed4.avif?t=1751843625\" data-has-big width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/36c3daf40f518f0ad3b98bf37d8c3391.poster.avif?t=1751843625\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/36c3daf40f518f0ad3b98bf37d8c3391.webm?t=1751843625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish and collect scrap to help you and the other survivors going. Use scrap to upgrade your boat and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/d7e26bbbeee5dfaa06395d83033ee273.avif?t=1751843625\" data-has-big width=800 height=155 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/a45edb0a7e03e6bcd634855ec6e73e91.poster.avif?t=1751843625\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367460/extras/a45edb0a7e03e6bcd634855ec6e73e91.webm?t=1751843625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep up with the other survivors on the island. Defeating Willie will require all the help you can get.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature list</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore open-world islands filled with hidden secrets and deadly threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself against Willie, the relentless steamboat spider stalking land and sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your steamboat with weapons and fishing gear to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage scarce resources - scavenge, fish, and upgrade to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate with survivors, forging vital bonds.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
